1
00:00:05,173 --> 00:00:07,513
(Penny:)So Sheldon's last roommate
tried to warn you off?

2
00:00:07,676 --> 00:00:11,056
(Leonard:)For all I knew, he was the crazy one.

3
00:00:11,429 --> 00:00:13,219
(Leonard:)He had this really deranged look.

4
00:00:13,890 --> 00:00:16,390
(Penny:)Well, yeah, he'd been living with Sheldon.

5
00:00:17,394 --> 00:00:19,394
(Leonard:)Sure, it makes sense now.

6
00:00:21,815 --> 00:00:24,855
(Leonard:)Anyway, I went upstairs
and knocked on the door.

7
00:00:31,032 --> 00:00:32,412
(Large Black Transvestite:)Yeah?

8
00:00:41,668 --> 00:00:42,918
(Past Leonard:)Dr. Cooper?

9
00:00:43,545 --> 00:00:46,045
(Transvestite:)No, you want the crazy guy
across the hall.

10
00:00:50,427 --> 00:00:53,597
LEONARD:
In retrospect, that was clue number two.

11
00:00:59,644 --> 00:01:02,024
(Past Sheldon:)-Yes?
-I'm Leonard Hofstadter.

